# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Scene hl2-return-battle (test/README.md): hldemo2 second visit from the
# hldemo3 tunnel: battle_master (trigger_once #520), the second battle
# (second_battle_mm, vortigaunts and grunts), the warehouse, the tripmine
# corridor, the crate wall shot down with the MP5: uplink.route lines 539-649
# (SHOT hldemo2-return .. SHOT elevator-return; the route's AI-heaviest
# hldemo2 frames). New Game on hldemo2: first-visit triggers unfired (the
# route's first visit fired them; its monsters are here, as there); the
# tripmine corridor is skipped by a setpos (its barriers stand).
# scene-window: uplink hldemo2-return elevator-return
startmap hldemo2
waitmap hldemo2 60
# the route's player has the suit here (hldemo1's item_suit): drop it on
# him (HLSDK CBaseEntity::Create, touch pickup)
setpos 2528 -48 -348 0 180
wait 0.3
drop item_suit 2528 -48 -348
drop weapon_9mmAR 2528 -48 -348
drop ammo_9mmAR 2528 -48 -348
drop ammo_9mmAR 2528 -48 -348
drop ammo_9mmAR 2528 -48 -348
drop weapon_crowbar 2528 -48 -348
wait 1.5
god 1
look 0 180
wait 0.5
stats begin
shot hldemo2-return
stats hldemo2-return
# tunnel west, crawl south (crouch-only y -64..-144) into the corridor, stand
# at its south end and climb ladder #48: passes trigger_once #520
# (z -96..-60) -> multisource battle_master enabled
setpos 2228 -20 -348 0 270
wait 0.3
+duck
wait 0.5
+forward
waitnear 2228 -200 -366 24 8
-duck
waitnear 2228 -456 -348 10 8
-forward
look -70 180
+forward
waitnear 2208 -456 75 20 8
-forward
# over the cage fence, drop into the corridor north of it and walk east
# into trigger_once #518 (master battle_master): killtarget spaz_door_1,
# second_battle_mm -> 2nd_pass_broken_door slams shut, dome_gate_1, spawns
setpos 2228 -336 84 0 90
wait 0.3
setpos 2300 -296 -60 0 0
wait 0.3
+forward
waitmoved 2nd_pass_broken_door 15
-forward
# around the second-battle yard to trigger_once #561 -> teleport_mm1
setpos 2700 -356 -60 0 0
wait 0.3
setpos 2980 -356 -60 0 90
wait 0.3
setpos 2980 -40 -60 0 90
wait 0.3
setpos 2904 40 -60 0 180
wait 1
# north out of the yard past the trailers and the radio table (the MP5 was
# taken there on the first visit and stays taken); select the MP5
setpos 2500 300 -60 0 90
wait 0.3
setpos 2520 700 -60 0 90
wait 0.3
setpos 2246 700 -60 0 90
wait 0.5
impulse 5
setpos 2300 1100 -60 0 180
wait 0.3
# trigger_once #563 (master battle_master) -> vort_grunt_battle_2_mm
setpos 1986 1100 -60 0 180
wait 0.5
# south through the (start-open) warehouse gate into the warehouse
setpos 1700 1100 -60 0 270
+forward
waitnear 1700 960 -60 40 8
-forward
setpos 2050 0 -60 0 270
wait 0.3
setpos 2050 -580 -60 0 180
wait 0.3
# tripmine corridor west: on the route's return its barriers #201 / #205,
# the mines and zombie_crates are gone (first visit); here they stand, so
# the player is put past them (uplink 604-608 walk 1400 -> 890)
setpos 890 -440 196 0 180
wait 0.3
# zombie room north, west to the offices
setpos 830 -100 196 0 90
wait 0.3
setpos 600 -30 196 0 180
wait 0.3
setpos 300 -100 196 0 180
wait 0.3
setpos 200 -200 196 0 270
wait 0.3
# button #575 (master battle_master) raises 2nd_pass_broken_door back to
# its broken, half-open height (74u gap). The 2nd_vorts_beyond_door slaves
# (second_battle_mm +17 s) crowd the doorway, so step past them into the
# room beyond once the door is up (combat is not under test).
setpos 240 -240 196 0 0
wait 0.3
+use
wait 0.3
-use
wait 3
setpos 60 -560 196 0 180
wait 0.3
# crates #145-#149 wall off the elevator corridor: walk north into them with
# the MP5 firing (separate bursts then a walk left the player wedged at
# y -300 at 30 fps); the open lane through the broken stack is x -290..-274
# at its north end
setpos -282 -440 196 10 90
wait 0.3
+attack
+forward
waitnear -282 -206 196 24 20
-forward
-attack
# startele1 (wait -1) was left open by elestartmm on the first visit and the
# level state persists, so walk straight into the car (button #93 outside
# would toggle it shut and fire eledoordelaymm from outside the
# hldemo1to2 transition volume)
# (here New Game left them shut: the outside button #93, model *25, opens
# them first, as in test/scenes/seam-2to1.route)
setpos -330 -248 196 10 180
wait 0.3
+use
wait 0.3
-use
waitmoved startele1 5
wait 1.5
setpos -380 -130 196 0 180
+forward
waitnear -470 -130 196 40 6
-forward
shot elevator-return
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
